WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.105
Every client conversation creates work.

2
00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:08.182
Notes to write up, records to update, follow-ups to send.

3
00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:09.890
Fifteen hours a week of it.

4
00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:11.860
So we built Client Intelligence.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.555
Write the note you'd write anyway.

6
00:00:14.555 --> 00:00:17.391
It picks out what matters: the budget, the dial, the material.

7
00:00:17.391 --> 00:00:19.470
Accept it, and her profile's up to date.

8
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.820
It finds the right piece in stock.

9
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.080
And drafts a personal follow-up. Check it,

10
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:42.476
send it,

11
00:00:42.476 --> 00:00:45.400
and it's on her record for whoever she speaks to next.

12
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.217
Fifteen hours a week back,

13
00:00:56.217 --> 00:00:58.620
and every follow-up out in under five minutes.

14
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.950
Every client. Remembered.
